    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Penthouse 8 at The Courtyard, Bundoran is a standout Three bed penthouse apartment offering modern style, excellent energy efficiency, and a superb top floor position. \n\nThe open plan living and dining area is bright and inviting, with large windows framing panoramic views of Benbulben. One of the North West`s most iconic landmarks. With a strong B1 BER, this home is warm, economical, and finished to a high contemporary standard throughout.\n The kitchen is sleek and modern, ideal for both everyday use and entertaining.\n\nThere are three generous bedrooms, including a beautifully finished ensuite master bedroom, offering comfort and privacy. The remaining bedrooms are well proportioned and versatile, suitable for guests, family, or home office use.\n\nPenthouse 8 combines modern living, energy efficiency, and a prime Bundoran location, an ideal home or investment opportunity."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 4.3m (14'1\") x 1.2m (3'11\")\nWalls painted, Tile flooring, 1no, Radiator\n\n - 4.2m (13'9\") x 1.4m (4'7\")\n\nKitchen/Dining room - 6.9m (22'8\") x 5.6m (18'4\")\nWalls painted, Floors tiled, Feature Windows, 1no. Radiator, High & Low level units tiled between, Wash hand basin, Electric Hob & Oven\n\nMain Bathroom - 3.2m (10'6\") x 2.4m (7'10\")\nWalls Tiled, Walls tiled, 1no. Window, 1no. Radiator, Wash hand basin, WC, Corner Shower, Heated towel rail.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.3m (14'1\") x 2.8m (9'2\")\nWalls painted, Laminated flooring, 1no. Window, 1no. Radiator\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.4m (14'5\") x 2.8m (9'2\")\nWalls painted, Laminated flooring, 2no. Window & window seat, 1no. Radiator\n\nEnsuite - 2m (6'7\") x 1.6m (5'3\")\nWalls painted, Floors tiled, 1no. Radiator, Wash hand basin, WC, Corner Shower\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.3m (10'10\") x 3.1m (10'2\")\nWalls painted, Laminated flooring, 1no. Window, 1no. Radiator\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
